            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kodun çalışıp çalışmadığını kontrol et. Testler çalışıyorsa <em>veya</em> çıktı istenen sonucu veriyorsa kod çalışıyor demektir.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" testsRun = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" outputShows = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = testsRun || outputShows; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Code working? : &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + result);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"86\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&amp;&amp;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Code working? : true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>testsRun</code>, ardından <code>||</code> ve son olarak <code>outputShows</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Testler çalıştığında veya çıktı doğru olduğunda kod çalışır. <code>testsRun</code> ile <code>outputShows</code> değerlerini OR ile birleştir.</p><p><code>testsRun</code> solda kalsın ve konsolun <code>Code working? : true</code> göstermesi için <code>outputShows</code> değerini ayarla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" testsRun = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" outputShows = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = testsRun || outputShows; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Code working? : &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + result);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"86\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&amp;&amp;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Code working? : true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>true</code>, ardından <code>testsRun</code>, <code>||</code> ve son olarak <code>outputShows</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
